{"id":67290,"date":"2026-01-06T23:23:12","date_gmt":"2026-01-06T22:23:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67290"},"modified":"2026-09-06T21:59:51","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06T20:59:51","slug":"pt281-ultramarathon","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/pt281-ultramarathon\/","title":{"rendered":"PT281 Ultramarathon 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">PT281 Ultramarathon 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>PT281 Ultramarathon 2027<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das mais lend\u00e1rias e extremas ultramaratonas de endurance cont\u00ednuo do mundo, percorrendo uma travessia linear de <strong>281 km<\/strong> ao longo do territ\u00f3rio hist\u00f3rico da <strong>Beira Baixa<\/strong>. Com partida solene no imponente <strong>Castelo de Belmonte<\/strong> e chegada triunfal em <strong>Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova<\/strong>, a prova desafia atletas de elite internacional em regime de <strong>semiautossufici\u00eancia e navega\u00e7\u00e3o exclusiva por GPS<\/strong>, enfrentando as lend\u00e1rias temperaturas t\u00f3rridas do ver\u00e3o ib\u00e9rico, frequentemente superiores aos <strong>40\u00b0C<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela prestigiada equipa da <strong>Horizontes<\/strong> em conjunto com a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Interior Convida<\/strong>, a jornada conta com um desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado de cerca de <strong>6.500 m D+<\/strong> e um exigente tempo limite de <strong>66 horas<\/strong>. O itiner\u00e1rio atravessa castelos medievais, aldeias hist\u00f3ricas e geomonumentos \u00fanicos em concelhos como <strong>Sabugal<\/strong>, <strong>Penamacor<\/strong>, <strong>Penha Garcia<\/strong>, <strong>Idanha-a-Nova<\/strong>, <strong>Castelo Branco<\/strong> e <strong>Vila Velha de R\u00f3d\u00e3o<\/strong>, dispondo de 8 Bases de Apoio (BA) com suporte log\u00edstico, alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o e assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica para coroar os verdadeiros guerreiros do endurance.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 a 18 de julho de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Belmonte a Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova, Beira Baixa, Castelo Branco<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">281 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Horizontes e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Interior Convida<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">66 horas<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Endurance<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">PT281 Ultramarathon<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Jul \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00 \u2022 6500m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Abertura de Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es:<\/strong> A confirmar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Brevemente)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data oficial e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da PT281 Ultramarathon 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se entre 15 e 18 de julho de 2027. A rece\u00e7\u00e3o aos atletas ocorre a 14 de julho e a partida oficial tem lugar na quinta-feira, 15 de julho, \u00e0s 18:00h, junto ao Castelo de Belmonte.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde come\u00e7a e onde termina o percurso da PT281?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Trata-se de um percurso estritamente linear com partida hist\u00f3rica no concelho de Belmonte e meta final instalada em Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova, atravessando grande parte da Beira Baixa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia, desn\u00edvel acumulado e tempo limite para concluir a prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova tem a extens\u00e3o oficial de 281 km com cerca de 6.500 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado (6.500m D+) e uma barreira hor\u00e1ria m\u00e1xima de 66 horas para cruzar a meta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a navega\u00e7\u00e3o e o regime de autonomia dos participantes?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova disputa-se em semiautossufici\u00eancia. O percurso n\u00e3o possui marca\u00e7\u00f5es f\u00edsicas no terreno, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de equipamento de navega\u00e7\u00e3o GPS e o cumprimento rigoroso da lista de material obrigat\u00f3rio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem bases de apoio ao longo dos 281 km da corrida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza 8 Bases de Apoio (BA) estrategicamente distribu\u00eddas (Sabugal, Penamacor, Penha Garcia, Idanha-a-Nova, Lentiscais, Vila Velha de R\u00f3d\u00e3o, Montes da Senhora e Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova) para descanso, alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quente e assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"PT281 Ultramarathon 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-07-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Belmonte a Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova, Beira Baixa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova\", \"addressRegion\": \"Castelo Branco\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Horizontes e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Interior Convida\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data oficial e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da PT281 Ultramarathon 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se entre 15 e 18 de julho de 2027. A rece\u00e7\u00e3o aos atletas ocorre a 14 de julho e a partida oficial tem lugar na quinta-feira, 15 de julho, \u00e0s 18:00h, junto ao Castelo de Belmonte.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde come\u00e7a e onde termina o percurso da PT281?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Trata-se de um percurso estritamente linear com partida hist\u00f3rica no concelho de Belmonte e meta final instalada em Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova, atravessando grande parte da Beira Baixa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia, desn\u00edvel acumulado e tempo limite para concluir a prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova tem a extens\u00e3o oficial de 281 km com cerca de 6.500 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado (6.500m D+) e uma barreira hor\u00e1ria m\u00e1xima de 66 horas para cruzar a meta.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona a navega\u00e7\u00e3o e o regime de autonomia dos participantes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova disputa-se em semiautossufici\u00eancia. O percurso n\u00e3o possui marca\u00e7\u00f5es f\u00edsicas no terreno, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de equipamento de navega\u00e7\u00e3o GPS e o cumprimento rigoroso da lista de material obrigat\u00f3rio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existem bases de apoio ao longo dos 281 km da corrida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza 8 Bases de Apoio (BA) estrategicamente distribu\u00eddas (Sabugal, Penamacor, Penha Garcia, Idanha-a-Nova, Lentiscais, Vila Velha de R\u00f3d\u00e3o, Montes da Senhora e Proen\u00e7a-a-Nova) para descanso, alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quente e assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67291,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,622],"event_type_2":[535,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67290","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-proenca-a-nova-castel